(:id "port/python/vt/optional-fields" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/vtoptional_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtOptionalRows/optional-fields" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtoptional_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtOptionalRowsNegativeControl" "make/python-vt-optional-rows.mk: python-vt-optional-rows python-vt-optional-rows-negative-control") :tested-revision "0e43df15ccf96313be5ff200cac554b4fc5703c3" :note "2026-11-17: the row over every manifest case the Lua leg names for it (chain_optional, chain_optional_empty, the P1/P2/P3 report rows at the declared root and again with the root variable, optional_absent_no_edge, optional_present_edge) and the optional_variable and optional_map constructs: each reads and writes back the engine's bytes or refuses as reports.txt says, the caller's buffer and report untouched; four planted optional faults in a copy of the emitted package turn their named cases red. Run on macOS arm64 under both pinned interpreters, CPython 3.11.18 and 3.15.2 (make dist-python), SCHEMA_SLOW=1, at this revision.")
(:id "port/python/vt/optional-arrays" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/vtoptional_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtOptionalRows/optional-arrays" "internal/codegen/pythontable/vtoptional_rows_test.go: TestPythonVtOptionalRowsNegativeControl" "make/python-vt-optional-rows.mk: python-vt-optional-rows python-vt-optional-rows-negative-control") :tested-revision "0e43df15ccf96313be5ff200cac554b4fc5703c3" :note "2026-11-17: the row over every manifest case the Lua leg names for it (message_trace, message_save, message_empty, and trace_elem_kind, trace_count_past_bound and marks_unknown_variant at the declared root and again with the root variable): each reads and writes back the engine's bytes or refuses as reports.txt says, the caller's buffer and report untouched; the planted faults (a present optional elided, fixed presence dropped, absent read as present, count and element kind unchecked) turn their named cases red. Run on macOS arm64 under both pinned interpreters, CPython 3.11.18 and 3.15.2 (make dist-python), SCHEMA_SLOW=1, at this revision.")
